--- !u!114 &3941815196721542307
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7172778692015809024}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ee71bae2b2ea2d4386dce41c6feac80, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialoguebox
  DialogueSegments:
  - Dialogue: Hey! You heading towards that tower aswell? I don't know why, but it
      felt like it was calling to me. Maybe you feel the same?
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fa34f4dd216b47146b90152f19617076, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: Yeah. Is there no way around this bridge?
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eaff7ea8a8cfb0e45b2ee58dbe2e539a, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: "Oh, there is! Right over there, through the cliffs. But you\u2019ll
      have to find a way to reach the other side."
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fa34f4dd216b47146b90152f19617076, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: "And I wouldn\u2019t really been able to go, since it's too narrow
      for Cold Air here to fit through, and I don't really want to leave her behind.
      She's brought me this far.. "
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fa34f4dd216b47146b90152f19617076, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: 'Then again, I heard people saying those who go to that tower never
      come back. So it might be a bit dangerous to take her any further. '
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fa34f4dd216b47146b90152f19617076, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: Right, well, thanks. Good luck with your horse.
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eaff7ea8a8cfb0e45b2ee58dbe2e539a, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: Goodbye!
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fa34f4dd216b47146b90152f19617076, type: 2}
    Choices: []
